uki","role":"Zombina (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/b8Qgk7OXuOGyNqWfGGw0JB9uFvh.jpg"},{"id":1339189,"name":"Saori Onishi","role":"Doppel (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cziKB19QMFJ6DQDtxTn07uRY2hq.jpg"},{"id":1288294,"name":"Yurika Kubo","role":"Tionisia (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tpzwj1J6HRq2H6xZjM5Irg7FzT2.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Monster Musume Everyday Life with Monster Girls","overview":"Tre anni fa, il mondo ha scoperto che le arpie, i centauri, le ragazze gatto e tutti i modi di creature favolose non sono solo finzione; sono carne e ossa, per non parlare di scaglie, piume, corno e zanne. Grazie al \"Cultural Exchange Between Species Act\", queste creature un tempo mitiche si sono assimilate nella società, o almeno ci stanno provando. Quando uno sfortunato adolescente umano di nome Kurusu Kimihito viene inserito come \"volontario\" nel programma di scambio del governo, il suo mondo viene sconvolto. Una lamia simile a un serpente di nome Miia viene a vivere con lui, ed è compito di Kurusu prendersi cura di lei e assicurarsi che si integri nella sua vita quotidiana."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Monster Musume: Everyday Life with Monster Girls","overview":"Three years ago, the world learned that harpies, centaurs, catgirls, and all manners of fabulous creatures are not merely fiction; they are flesh and blood - not to mention scale, feather, horn, and fang. Thanks to the \"Cultural Exchange Between Species Act,\" these once-mythical creatures have assimilated into society, or at least, they're trying. When a hapless human teenager named Kurusu Kimihito is inducted as a \"volunteer\" into the government exchange program, his world is turned upside down. A snake-like lamia named Miia comes to live with him, and it is Kurusu's job to take care of her and make sure she integrates into his everyday life."},{"language":"ja-JP","overview":"「他種族間交流法」の施行により、 人間以外の種族との交流が認められた日本。 ある手違いにより、主人公・来留主公人のもとに他種族の 女の子（モンスター娘）たちが続々と 転がり込んできて、共同生活を送ることに…！？ モテモテハーレム状態だけど、 他種族とのふか～い交流（♡）は、 法律で厳しく禁止されていて…？ 可愛いけれど、ちょっとちがうモンスター娘たちと過ごす、 少し変わった毎日がはじまる…♡","tagline":"「普通の娘」じゃなきゃ、ダメですか？"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/n0ZQ2z5QCUw1QrZn1IA4LLBfu0X.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/n0ZQ2z5QCUw1QrZn1IA4LLBfu0X.png","language":"en","width":633,"height":297},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rgbr3yNPTrpeSuBHOqj4iUJYWEX.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rgbr3yNPTrpeSuBHOqj4iUJYWEX.png","language":"en","width":475,"height":297},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xdD28EZC3jb4DcuesUkNPAsu3uH.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xdD28EZC3jb4DcuesUkNPAsu3uH.png","language":"ja","width":536,"height":295}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8leXiwIwPRPQqHXKDhqgf4OIwBU.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8leXiwIwPRPQqHXKDhqgf4OIwBU.jpg","language":"en","width":500,"height":750},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5TbO0xSzdGjvmaWfyioxL6kIkZP.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5TbO0xSzdGjvmaWfyioxL6kIkZP.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iXpT0DIS9V1NqWkDG2YeTVlnpuZ.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iXpT0DIS9V1NqWkDG2YeTVlnpuZ.jpg","language":"en","width":1400,"height":1995},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8F2x9j1fO9wUCeH66TfIqEZF09n.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8F2x9j1fO9wUCeH66TfIqEZF09n.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cJWQD7azDvOa6tdxddLcUIyoDWn.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cJWQD7azDvOa6tdxddLcUIyoDWn.jpg","language":"en","width":750,"he